  "description": "Tkemali - Georgian restaurant in the center of Moscow. We offer variety of vegetables and meat cooked on fire, delicious bread, exceptional spices and sauces. In addition, Tkemali offers guests a traditional Georgian set for two, happy hours and special offers. We are constantly trying to surprise our guests with new menu items, as well as introduce seasonal dishes. For the guests of “Tkemali” – cozy rooms on two levels, large tables with soft sofas and armchairs, a bright interior with home Georgian decor we brought from Tbilisi. On the second floor there are two balconies that can be as a private area for your special events. In the warm season, a summer terrace is open for guests.",
